                <l xml:id="m-2a541316-842d-4392-a6ea-04abe5fc7c61" facs="#m-33915111-78de-484d-bd0d-c0116bcfb85d" label="ambiguous">sis</l><l xml:id="m-72d01c13-477c-49df-9632-27435bb68044" facs="#m-6d09e947-949c-421d-b91b-a419dbd4b89b" label="text-like">Monday and Tuesday aiter Quinquagesima.</l><l xml:id="m-72d348e1-27b4-4004-9522-00ab4bf95390" facs="#m-fae3c338-9107-46af-867b-157aeca7b3ab" label="lyrics-like">V. Dirigátur Dómine orátio méa.</l><l xml:id="m-2c441a0b-81e1-4423-9034-9ceaae371413" facs="#m-6492d25b-a9cd-436f-bc9e-6ace5cdbc1fa" label="lyrics-like">B. Sicut incénsum in conspéctu túo.</l><l xml:id="m-4acb5b69-2bf0-4308-b010-9b08205884c2" facs="#m-97eabdff-5f14-43f1-a73a-390c94384a64" label="text-like">At Magn. Ant. Et qui praesbant. p. 515.</l><l xml:id="m-e77393c0-9f4e-470e-a89c-b1705c1155cf" facs="#m-9972f2e7-a3f1-457a-9c43-0b8e455702c7" label="lyrics-like">Cant. Magníficat. 7. a. p. 211.</l><l xml:id="m-dcbfcb55-213b-4edd-80d4-dd814e8b2334" facs="#m-c61a5cc8-540c-487c-927c-100a883ab21b" label="ambiguous">Tuesday.</l><l xml:id="m-66f88234-9992-4ded-ac29-8f5e2851c032" facs="#m-586c683a-416c-4a4e-984c-e98ee440b317" label="ambiguous">Hymn.E</l><l xml:id="m-4d1e4f92-aef5-4a47-a3fd-4260b75d2378" facs="#m-d3e99da9-973f-4041-9314-0e0a0fc76fb4" label="ambiguous">1.</l><l xml:id="m-025d7944-53cd-4188-80e9-380990626a5a" facs="#m-3be66f2d-cd21-4e82-924f-c4298c83ff96" label="lyrics-like">Ellú-ris âlme Cóndi-tor, Múndi sólum qui sépa¬</l><l xml:id="m-4ddf2458-9182-44a4-9399-3fc19cc0b6c3" facs="#m-f8b92511-0331-4c8c-a824-1c71c8737815" label="ambiguous">A</l><l xml:id="m-e0ebdf80-5167-4c16-b522-07cd044fdb8a" facs="#m-93771e17-60e5-41fb-883d-cb0676ab0b66" label="lyrics-like">rans, Púlsis áquae molésti-is, Térram dedísti immóbi-lem:</l><l xml:id="m-9970d14e-d207-463c-8434-d2ac6b61e60f" facs="#m-300c6c84-9258-49f5-adc9-fef283a17f84" label="lyrics-like">Ut gérmen áptum próferens.</l><l xml:id="m-067a92e8-c7cc-47a1-ae18-2cb3b0baeea6" facs="#m-1de7390a-0e7a-4aaf-b146-dd3b78bc3c04" label="lyrics-like">Jússis túis obtémperet,</l><l xml:id="m-7f2e62c2-0ff7-48e9-b6d4-077402af3d53" facs="#m-1307913c-97a2-4c18-a30b-a50e30a81109" label="lyrics-like">Fúlvis decóra flóribus,</l><l xml:id="m-bafd29d2-0748-4b88-ad06-a317884b08cb" facs="#m-fbd7a64e-c975-46bc-b536-b11ad2a4e41e" label="lyrics-like">Núllis mális appróximet:</l><l xml:id="m-60db07cd-d90f-4a1e-8014-8a551ecaad40" facs="#m-b21fdcaf-0792-4111-bde3-67a1f3844e1d" label="lyrics-like">Foecúnda frúctu sisteret,</l><l xml:id="m-8f50c522-5d7b-4b08-ad95-04a8474e06f9" facs="#m-ef85ab3f-38ef-4397-be42-8bf513eadf74" label="lyrics-like">Bónis repléri gâudeat,</l><l xml:id="m-56d34ed7-2f26-44a7-87aa-de3cbff86f5a" facs="#m-4ee39327-fcc1-4c44-966c-e2643cedc919" label="lyrics-like">Et mórtis ictum nésciat.</l><l xml:id="m-168a32e6-c0da-4904-be52-7cf170985cd0" facs="#m-55b04c11-62f8-4283-b92d-6873791ac07e" label="lyrics-like">Pastúmque grátum rédderet.</l><l xml:id="m-38b37dc6-a772-48da-a835-0b330f054e24" facs="#m-f8592129-0984-4b3d-8060-7208bf478a00" label="lyrics-like">Praésta, Páter piissime,</l><l xml:id="m-291b5aa4-6fc6-4941-93b2-19cfdfb16624" facs="#m-3ce6c736-0734-45c7-9425-b5382c5afc5a" label="lyrics-like">Méntis perústae vúlnera</l><l xml:id="m-de1096fe-df2c-4cfd-a044-0285f1fbab08" facs="#m-1abfb6bf-8588-465a-8e06-112c67f728e3" label="lyrics-like">Múnda virôre grátiae:</l><l xml:id="m-8517fcca-58ad-49ef-939b-b901c69cef87" facs="#m-d7faff37-595c-4dd8-bdd8-d29a95aa66c9" label="lyrics-like">Patrique cómpar Unice,</l><l xml:id="m-2cd64543-dcac-4f8a-a314-efa9819996b1" facs="#m-2e96c0d3-af16-40c6-83f0-01c276136263" label="lyrics-like">Ut fácta flétu diluat.</l><l xml:id="m-1568fef5-a0ce-4043-8ac5-57035f0d64a5" facs="#m-1dfae0e7-b187-4d5a-849b-b615eebfcf58" label="lyrics-like">Cum Spíritu Paráclito.</l><l xml:id="m-6f09425c-478f-4011-a56a-ff713082d48e" facs="#m-00936ceb-84eb-45ab-b934-b1e86332f6a2" label="lyrics-like">Motúsque právos átterat.</l><l xml:id="m-21c4ec92-4188-41f8-82a4-fa76d267952a" facs="#m-0c6e2f2d-22b5-4805-827e-276af7fa0fda" label="lyrics-like">Régnans per ómne saéculum.</l><l xml:id="m-8955eb23-18cb-46c8-979c-eac7d66ffa84" facs="#m-1cb6ba1e-f340-4c3f-98d4-a49b9510564f" label="ambiguous">Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-5419c04a-ec04-4752-adca-4327130d6525" facs="#m-4b85c889-6531-4d18-9985-d5642c3fa2b1" label="lyrics-like">v. Dirigátur Dómine orátio méa.</l><l xml:id="m-0b66b75f-8edf-4e46-aff6-76ff28e5bf3b" facs="#m-2dd9c6a9-a533-489f-bc36-c89f8fc532b7" label="lyrics-like">R. Sicut incénsum in conspectu túo.</l><l xml:id="m-df055340-d310-4f17-88bc-102406ec2bee" facs="#m-465674de-e99a-4ea4-a06c-c7b4a7a9eb2a" label="text-like">At Magn.</l><l xml:id="m-e56b0cad-165b-4959-8da6-f3ff88a9c71a" facs="#m-eafff22d-b3be-4df5-ad15-28a84ff41fb6" label="ambiguous">Ant. S. G</l><l xml:id="m-777f5ebc-d3cb-4203-a9f7-7ca7bc903916" facs="#m-afed0860-dc65-41e1-8d41-7976a4d04674" label="lyrics-like">I-serére mé-i, " Fi-li Dá-vid. Quid vis ut fá¬</l><l xml:id="m-a86a7fbf-6eae-4007-861f-bfed77aeafca" facs="#m-8f6365b4-d87a-426b-8be4-43502182478f" label="lyrics-like">ci-am ti-bi? Dómine, ut víde-am. E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-7d9a011b-61b8-4391-a385-3d61652059ad" facs="#m-3293faac-7322-4637-8694-4806ed8b2545" label="lyrics-like">Cant. Magníficat. 8. G. p. 212</l><l xml:id="m-80d1516f-29df-4d85-affc-52444178a9a2" facs="#m-c5dab314-b3b8-4997-81d0-529d2f134c8a" label="lyrics-like">Then the V. Dóminus vobiscum. is said with the Prayer of Quinquagesima</l><l xml:id="m-cadcf9ba-630c-4ea4-809b-d31cc5d173bc" facs="#m-fd3972c3-f542-4178-9aa7-76ce41da4550" label="text-like">sunday, p. 512, and the Suffrage of all the Saints is adaed, p. 260.</l><l xml:id="m-f734cd04-8b46-49ce-a9ac-f83cc9ec65d0" facs="#m-2579b2c1-16ea-425c-a9a2-2deb41e1e513" label="text-like">At compline, Antiphons and Psalms: Monday. p. 283; Tuesday, p. 288.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>